      hu: "A Thimphu-völgy fő folyója átszeli Bhután fővárosát, és festői szurdokot formál az ország nyugati részén.",
      ro: "Râul principal al văii Thimphu curge prin capitala Bhutanului și formează un defileu pitoresc în vestul țării.",
      en: "The main river of the Thimphu Valley runs through Bhutan's capital and forms a picturesque gorge in the west of the country.",
