      hu: "Egy veszélyes gleccsertó a Lunana régióban, amely a múltban már okozott katasztrofális villámárvizeket a morénák átszakadása miatt.",
      ro: "Un lac glaciar periculos în regiunea Lunana, care a provocat deja inundații catastrofale în trecut prin ruperea morenelor.",
      en: "A dangerous glacial lake in the Lunana region, which has already caused catastrophic flash floods in the past due to moraine breaches.",
